     COMPUTE WS-CHK = PC-BBW
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-SCALE
     MOVE 20 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     PERFORM ASSERT-SCALED
     MOVE 1000 TO PC-LIFETIME
     MOVE 0 TO PC-XD PC-ZD PC-YD
     MOVE 1 TO WS-ONE
     PERFORM 200 TIMES
