 ASSERT-NUMBER.
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-CASE
     STRING "acceptance US12 42-3§5 Bubbles, splashes and water currents: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-NAME)
         DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-CASE
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
